<view class="page"><view class="demo">独立开发演示 · 所有价格非正式报价</view><view class="eyebrow">LUNARIA</view><view class="title">留一点时间，照顾自己</view><view class="subtitle">单店 · 店长亲自服务 · 预约后等待确认</view><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="card"><view class="heading">体验顾客端</view><view class="muted">微信身份尚未接入，仅本机演示。</view><button data-user="alice" bindtap="demoLogin" loading="{{busy}}">林女士 · 演示专属价</button><button class="secondary" data-user="bob" bindtap="demoLogin" loading="{{busy}}">陈女士 · 演示普通价</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载护理与套餐…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重新加载</button></view><view wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="card row"><view><view class="small muted">{{name}} · 可用本金余额</view><view class="amount">¥ {{balance}}</view></view><view class="tag">开发账户</view></view><view class="heading section">日常护理</view><view wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.duration}} 分钟</view></view><button class="secondary" data-service="{{item.id}}" bindtap="book">查看可约时段</button></view><view class="heading section">把护理变成习惯</view><view wx:if="{{!packages.length}}" class="empty">暂无在售套餐，请联系店长。</view><view wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">同一项目 {{item.total}} 次 · {{item.duration}} 分钟 / 次</view><view class="amount">¥ {{item.priceText}}</view><view class="small muted" wx:if="{{item.tier_price_cents}}">本套餐专属演示价 · 默认 ¥{{item.defaultPriceText}}</view><view class="rule">取消预约不扣次；服务完成才扣次。默认按实付比例退卡，原购卡权益保留。</view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="purchase" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">余额购卡</button></view><view class="rule">等级策略演示按已履约服务实付价值累计，最终规则待确认；微信支付与通知尚未开通。</view></view></view>
